> **Farzana says:** "The bezel baguette three-stone is the most practical choice for most buyers. The bezel holds the side stones from all sides — no prong catches on fabric, no stone movement over time. And baguettes beside a radiant just look correct. The first time I put this ring next to a radiant with round sides, I couldn't go back."

